<title>SPAIN: Spain's Tabacalera to bid for Portugal firm.</title>
<headline>Spain's Tabacalera to bid for Portugal firm.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish tobacco producer Tabacalera said on Monday it had submitted a bid for Portugal's state-owned tobacco firm Tabaqueira, which is being privatised.</p>
<p>&quot;(Tabacalera) has presented a bid for Tabaqueira,&quot; a company source who did not want to be named told Reuters.</p>
<p>Bids are to be opened in Lisbon at 0900 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Tabacalera, which is majority state-owned, denied last month that it was interested in the Portugese firm.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1  585 2151</p>
</text>
